15:40.660 --> 15:43.000
JUJUTSU KAISEN

15:43.000 --> 15:45.760
Please, Itadori.

15:46.270 --> 15:48.350
I need your power.

15:50.220 --> 15:51.600
Okkotsu-senpai.

15:52.430 --> 15:54.790
Sukuna is plotting something
that uses Fushiguro.

15:56.290 --> 15:58.850
He was probably able to take
over my body in Shibuya

15:58.850 --> 16:02.290
because I was force-fed ten fingers at once.

16:02.290 --> 16:05.260
There are now 15 fingers inside me.

16:05.260 --> 16:07.890
Even if I'm fed the remaining
five all at once,

16:07.890 --> 16:10.010
I don't think he'll be able to take me over.

16:10.010 --> 16:11.270
But even so,

16:11.770 --> 16:14.360
if Sukuna does manage to take control again,

16:14.360 --> 16:15.840
don't hesitate to kill me.

16:16.700 --> 16:18.430
I trust you can do that, Senpai.

16:20.280 --> 16:21.310
All right.

16:22.200 --> 16:24.040
I'll do my best.

16:24.860 --> 16:25.970
Fushiguro.

16:26.460 --> 16:27.900
What do I need to do?

16:28.850 --> 16:30.790
First, we return to Jujutsu High

16:30.790 --> 16:33.000
and contact Tengen-sama.

16:35.770 --> 16:37.930
How can we release the
seal of the Prison Realm?

16:38.720 --> 16:41.240
What is Noritoshi Kamo's actual goal,

16:41.240 --> 16:42.680
and what moves will he make?

16:43.170 --> 16:45.960
The culling game is an unprecedented
act of jujutsu terrorism,

16:45.960 --> 16:49.550
and we need answers to those two
questions to resolve the situation.

16:50.000 --> 16:53.430
I think Tengen-sama's the only
one capable of answering them.

16:53.890 --> 16:55.390
What about that woman?

16:55.390 --> 16:57.300
Wouldn't Tsukumo-san know?

16:57.820 --> 17:00.110
I've already spoken with Tsukumo-san.

17:00.110 --> 17:01.820
This was her plan.

17:02.360 --> 17:05.350
She's also hiding away at Jujutsu High.

17:06.620 --> 17:08.040
Hiding away?

17:08.040 --> 17:10.650
Apparently, she doesn't want
to deal with the higher-ups.

17:11.080 --> 17:15.100
The problem is Tengen-sama's
concealment barriers.

17:15.960 --> 17:19.680
Out of 1,000 constantly shuffling doors,

17:19.680 --> 17:23.990
only one leads to the Tombs of the Star
where Tengen-sama resides.

17:25.510 --> 17:27.920
So unless we can pick the right door,

17:27.920 --> 17:30.170
we can't meet with Tengen-sama?

17:34.460 --> 17:35.800
I'm sorry, Fushiguro.

17:45.230 --> 17:46.830
I'm going to ask now anyway.

17:50.830 --> 17:52.690
What happened to Kugisaki?

17:59.760 --> 18:00.990
I see.

18:04.500 --> 18:05.530
All right.

18:13.810 --> 18:15.080
All right!

18:16.480 --> 18:18.650
We might be able to do something

18:18.910 --> 18:21.180
about the concealment barriers.

18:22.400 --> 18:24.100
You were listening?

18:25.400 --> 18:27.310
What do you mean, Choso?

18:28.040 --> 18:29.850
You remember when Mahito stole

18:29.850 --> 18:32.020
Sukuna's fingers and us
Death Paintings, right?

18:33.200 --> 18:35.520
We'll do the same thing.

18:44.330 --> 18:47.140
It's been... not that long, really.

18:47.420 --> 18:48.700
Maki-senpai?!

18:49.890 --> 18:50.900
Oh, hello.

18:51.640 --> 18:52.920
Maki-san!

18:52.920 --> 18:54.810
Is safe for you to be up and moving already?

18:54.810 --> 18:56.750
Yeah, it's not an issue.

18:57.140 --> 18:59.260
Not much I could do about the burns.

18:59.260 --> 19:01.950
Scars remain, even with the
reverse cursed technique.

19:01.950 --> 19:05.720
Though your Heavenly Pact of
physical prowess is impressive.

19:05.720 --> 19:09.970
At the very end, your life was saved by
the strength of your body's endurance

19:09.970 --> 19:12.130
rather than your resistance to curses.

19:12.360 --> 19:14.600
It's a shame the clan head didn't make it.

19:14.600 --> 19:17.190
It's not like it was a competition.

19:18.500 --> 19:21.680
Megumi, how goes it with
Tengen-sama's barrier?

19:22.380 --> 19:23.560
Well...

19:23.970 --> 19:25.250
I'll explain.

19:25.960 --> 19:28.340
On the way to the Tombs of the Star

19:28.340 --> 19:32.420
is the forbidden vault holding Jujutsu High's
cursed tools and cursed objects, right?

19:32.420 --> 19:35.020
The remains of my brothers—

19:35.020 --> 19:39.150
Noranso, Sho-oso, Tanso,
Sanso, Kotsuso, and Shoso—

19:39.150 --> 19:41.410
are in the forbidden vault.

19:41.410 --> 19:43.770
Even if it's just their remains,
with all six together,

19:43.770 --> 19:45.900
I should be able to sense their presence

19:45.900 --> 19:48.180
using the side effect of my technique.

19:48.780 --> 19:50.030
Good!

19:50.030 --> 19:51.530
That's great to hear,

19:52.030 --> 19:53.680
but who's this?

19:57.250 --> 19:58.730
For now, you can say...

19:59.440 --> 20:01.500
he's my older brother.

20:01.930 --> 20:05.020
Yuji!

20:05.410 --> 20:06.310
Let's go.

20:09.370 --> 20:10.440
That one.

20:11.380 --> 20:12.910
I'm certain.

20:12.910 --> 20:15.600
My younger brothers are resting beyond here.

20:15.600 --> 20:16.560
I'm opening it.

20:16.560 --> 20:17.410
Yeah.

20:27.450 --> 20:28.660
Let's head down.

20:30.130 --> 20:33.540
There's an elevator leading to
the Tombs of the Star further in.

20:35.080 --> 20:36.290
Choso.

20:36.910 --> 20:38.060
I know.

20:39.000 --> 20:40.910
I'll come back for you later.

20:40.910 --> 20:42.960
Please wait a little longer.

20:48.710 --> 20:50.010
Blood stains?

20:50.010 --> 20:51.730
Did something happen?

20:51.730 --> 20:54.220
It was twelve years ago.

20:54.220 --> 20:55.720
Thinking back,

20:55.720 --> 20:59.620
all of the distortions may
have started back then.

21:00.540 --> 21:03.640
All right, everyone,
the main hall is up ahead.

21:20.260 --> 21:21.490
There's nothing here.

21:21.490 --> 21:23.280
This is the main hall?

21:23.280 --> 21:26.480
No, he's rejecting us.

21:27.050 --> 21:29.800
Tengen won't interfere with reality, but...

21:29.800 --> 21:32.700
I thought it would be
possible to reach him now,

21:32.700 --> 21:34.640
while the Six Eyes are sealed away,

21:34.640 --> 21:36.450
but my prediction was naïve.

21:38.260 --> 21:43.210
It's not all of us being
rejected... but just me?

21:45.050 --> 21:46.450
Let's head back.

21:46.450 --> 21:48.350
Tsumiki-san doesn't have time to spare.

21:51.030 --> 21:52.750
You're leaving?

21:54.080 --> 21:55.430
Nice to meet you.

21:55.430 --> 21:58.820
Child of Zen'in, Descendant of Michizane,

21:58.820 --> 22:01.110
Cursed Womb Death Painting,

22:03.550 --> 22:05.880
and Vessel of Sukuna.

23:40.280 --> 23:42.700
I must impose one condition.

23:42.700 --> 23:44.990
We came here to learn how
to open the Prison Realm.

23:44.170 --> 23:46.470
No greeting for me?

23:45.800 --> 23:47.120
Then why is this Culling Game...

23:47.120 --> 23:49.650
...to force the evolution of mankind...

23:48.880 --> 23:51.660
...it's better for the rules if being
stripped means death, too.

23:50.810 --> 23:53.550
If Sukuna does take control again,
don't hesitate to kill me.

23:52.030 --> 23:55.110
Next Episode
About the Culling Game

23:52.930 --> 23:54.340
Don't die out there.
